{
  "kind": "html",
  "caption": "二叉搜索树的中序遍历会按从小到大的顺序访问节点，因此访问到第 k 个节点时即可停止。示例 2 中访问顺序从 1、2 到 3，计数达到 k = 3，答案就是 3。若树经常修改且查询频繁，可在每个节点维护子树节点数，用左子树大小直接判断第 k 小元素位于哪一侧。",
  "html": "<!DOCTYPE html>\n<html lang=\"zh-CN\">\n<head>\n<meta charset=\"UTF-8\">\n<meta name=\"viewport\" content=\"width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0\">\n<title>二叉搜索树中第 K 小的元素</title>\n<style>\n  * { box-sizing: border-box; }\n  body{ margin: 0; background: #1c1c1c; color: #d4d4d4; font-family: -apple-system, BlinkMacSystemFont, \"PingFang SC\", sans-serif; font-size: 12px; line-height: 1.45; }\n  main{ max-width: 560px; margin: 0 auto; padding: 8px 10px 10px; }\n  h1 { margin: 0 0 4px; font-size: 14px; font-weight: 600; }\n  .lead { margin: 0 0 8px; color: #8d8d8d; font-size: 12px; }\n  .mono, .value, .count, .sequence { font-family: \"SF Mono\", Monaco, Menlo, monospace; }\n  .layout { display: grid; grid-template-columns: 1fr; gap: 8px; margin-top: 8px; }\n  .card { background: #252526; border: 1px solid #3c3c3c; border-radius: 6px; padding: 8px 10px; }\n  .card h2 { margin: 0 0 8px; font-size: 13px; font-weight: 600; }\n  .tree { display: grid; gap: 6px; }\n  .level { display: grid; gap: 6px; align-items: start; }\n  .level-1 { grid-template-columns: 1fr; }\n  .level-2 { grid-template-columns: repeat(2, 1fr); }\n  .level-3 { grid-template-columns: repeat(4, 1fr); }\n  .level-4 { grid-template-columns: repeat(4, 1fr); }\n  .slot { min-width: 0; display: flex; justify-content: center; }\n  .node { width: 38px; min-height: 48px; display: flex; flex-direction: column; align-items: center; justify-content: center; gap: 2px; border: 1px solid #3c3c3c; border-radius: 4px; background: #252526; transition: .35s; }\n  .node .value { font-size: 14px; font-weight: 600; }\n  .node .tag { font-size: 10px; color: #8d8d8d; }\n  .empty { min-height: 48px; color: #8d8d8d; font-size: 10px; display: flex; align-items: center; }\n  .node.visited { background: #17324d; border-color: #3794ff; }\n  .node.current { background: #0e639c; border-color: #79b8ff; color: #fff; }\n  .node.answer { background: #0e639c; border-color: #fff; }\n  .edges { text-align: center; color: #8d8d8d; font-size: 10px; min-height: 12px; }\n  .status { display: grid; gap: 8px; }\n  .metric { padding: 8px 10px; background: #1c1c1c; border: 1px solid #3c3c3c; border-radius: 6px; font-size: 12px; }\n  .metric-label { color: #8d8d8d; margin-bottom: 4px; font-size: 10px; }\n  .count { color: #3794ff; font-size: 13px; font-weight: 600; }\n  .step-text { min-height: auto; line-height: 1.45; font-size: 12px; }\n  .sequence-wrap { display: flex; flex-wrap: wrap; gap: 4px; margin-top: 6px; }\n  .chip { min-width: 28px; padding: 4px 6px; text-align: center; border: 1px solid #3c3c3c; border-radius: 4px; background: #252526; color: #8d8d8d; font-size: 12px; transition: .35s; }\n  .chip.done { color: #d4d4d4; border-color: #3794ff; background: #17324d; }\n  .chip.now { color: #fff; border-color: #79b8ff; background: #0e639c; }\n  .result { padding: 8px 10px; border-left: 3px solid #3794ff; background: #252526; font-size: 12px; }\n  .notes { display: grid; grid-template-columns: 1fr; gap: 8px; margin-top: 8px; }\n  .note { line-height: 1.45; font-size: 12px; }\n  .note b { color: #3794ff; display: block; margin-bottom: 4px; font-size: 13px; }\n\n.tree { position: relative; display: block; height: 308px; }\n.tree > svg { position: absolute; inset: 0; width: 100%; height: 100%; overflow: visible; }\n.tree > svg line { stroke: #8d8d8d; stroke-width: 1.5; vector-effect: non-scaling-stroke; }\n.tree .node { position: absolute; width: 64px; height: 50px; min-height: 50px; transform: translateX(-50%); }\n.tree .node .tag { white-space: nowrap; }\n</style>\n</head>\n<body>\n<main>\n  <h1>中序遍历：第 3 次访问即为答案</h1>\n  <p class=\"lead\">示例 2：<span class=\"mono\">root = [5,3,6,2,4,null,null,1]，k = 3</span></p>\n\n  <section class=\"layout\">\n    <div class=\"card\">\n      <h2>二叉搜索树</h2>\n      <div class=\"tree\" aria-label=\"5 的左孩子是 3, 右孩子是 6; 3 的孩子是 2 和 4; 2 的左孩子是 1.\"><svg viewBox=\"0 0 560 308\" preserveAspectRatio=\"none\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><line x1=\"280\" y1=\"50\" x2=\"160\" y2=\"84\"/><line x1=\"280\" y1=\"50\" x2=\"420\" y2=\"84\"/><line x1=\"160\" y1=\"134\" x2=\"90\" y2=\"168\"/><line x1=\"160\" y1=\"134\" x2=\"230\" y2=\"168\"/><line x1=\"90\" y1=\"218\" x2=\"45\" y2=\"252\"/></svg><div class=\"node\" data-v=\"5\" style=\"left:50.000000%;top:0px\"><span class=\"value\">5</span><span class=\"tag\">根</span></div><div class=\"node\" data-v=\"3\" style=\"left:28.571429%;top:84px\"><span class=\"value\">3</span><span class=\"tag\">5 的左</span></div><div class=\"node\" data-v=\"6\" style=\"left:75.000000%;top:84px\"><span class=\"value\">6</span><span class=\"tag\">5 的右</span></div><div class=\"node\" data-v=\"2\" style=\"left:16.071429%;top:168px\"><span class=\"value\">2</span><span class=\"tag\">3 的左</span></div><div class=\"node\" data-v=\"4\" style=\"left:41.071429%;top:168px\"><span class=\"value\">4</span><span class=\"tag\">3 的右</span></div><div class=\"node\" data-v=\"1\" style=\"left:8.035714%;top:252px\"><span class=\"value\">1</span><span class=\"tag\">2 的左</span></div></div>\n    </div>\n\n    <div class=\"card status\">\n      <h2>访问过程</h2>\n      <div class=\"metric\">\n        <div class=\"metric-label\">当前计数 / 目标</div>\n        <div><span class=\"count\" id=\"count\">0</span><span class=\"mono\"> / 3</span></div>\n      </div>\n      <div class=\"metric\">\n        <div class=\"metric-label\">中序序列</div>\n        <div class=\"sequence-wrap\">\n          <span class=\"chip mono\" data-i=\"1\">1</span>\n          <span class=\"chip mono\" data-i=\"2\">2</span>\n          <span class=\"chip mono\" data-i=\"3\">3</span>\n          <span class=\"chip mono\" data-i=\"4\">4</span>\n          <span class=\"chip mono\" data-i=\"5\">5</span>\n          <span class=\"chip mono\" data-i=\"6\">6</span>\n        </div>\n      </div>\n      <div class=\"step-text\" id=\"stepText\">先不断沿左孩子下降，寻找整棵树中最小的节点。</div>\n      <div class=\"result\" id=\"result\">遍历顺序遵循：<strong>左子树 → 当前节点 → 右子树</strong></div>\n    </div>\n  </section>\n\n  <section class=\"notes\">\n    <div class=\"card note\"><b>为什么有序</b>二叉搜索树中，左侧值更小、右侧值更大，所以中序遍历天然得到升序序列。</div>\n    <div class=\"card note\"><b>一次查询</b>访问到第 k 个节点就停止。时间为 <span class=\"mono\">O(h + k)</span>，显式栈空间为 <span class=\"mono\">O(h)</span>。</div>\n    <div class=\"card note\"><b>频繁修改与查询</b>每个节点额外维护子树大小，通过左子树节点数决定向左、返回当前节点或向右，单次查询可降至 <span class=\"mono\">O(h)</span>。</div>\n  </section>\n</main>\n<script>\n(() => {\n  const steps = [\n    { value: null, count: 0, text: '先不断沿左孩子下降：5 → 3 → 2 → 1，寻找最小值。' },\n    { value: 1, count: 1, text: '访问节点 1，计数变为 1；还没有达到 k = 3。' },\n    { value: 2, count: 2, text: '回到节点 2 并访问，计数变为 2；继续中序遍历。' },\n    { value: 3, count: 3, text: '访问节点 3，计数恰好达到 3，立即停止。' },\n    { value: 3, count: 3, text: '第 3 小的元素是 3。无需继续访问 4、5、6。', answer: true }\n  ];\n  let index = 0;\n  const nodes = [...document.querySelectorAll('.node')];\n  const chips = [...document.querySelectorAll('.chip')];\n  const count = document.getElementById('count');\n  const stepText = document.getElementById('stepText');\n  const result = document.getElementById('result');\n\n  function render(step) {\n    count.textContent = step.count;\n    stepText.textContent = step.text;\n    nodes.forEach(node => {\n      const value = Number(node.dataset.v);\n      node.classList.toggle('visited', step.count > 0 && value < (step.value ?? 0));\n      node.classList.toggle('current', value === step.value && !step.answer);\n      node.classList.toggle('answer', value === step.value && !!step.answer);\n    });\n    chips.forEach(chip => {\n      const i = Number(chip.dataset.i);\n      chip.classList.toggle('done', i < step.count);\n      chip.classList.toggle('now', i === step.count && step.count > 0);\n    });\n    result.innerHTML = step.answer\n      ? '找到答案：<strong class=\"mono\">第 3 小 = 3</strong>'\n      : '遍历顺序遵循：<strong>左子树 → 当前节点 → 右子树</strong>';\n  }\n\n  render(steps[0]);\n  setInterval(() => {\n    index = (index + 1) % steps.length;\n    render(steps[index]);\n  }, 1900);\n})();\n</script>\n</body>\n</html>",
  "svg": "",
  "media": ""
}
